# 16MB flash + internal dual-slot A/B (partitions_int.csv)
# Pair this with CONFIG_MINIHUB_OTA_EXTERNAL_STORAGE=n (menuconfig: Firmware update → OTA).
# The firmware upgrade then writes straight to ota_1 and reboots into it instead
# of staging to SD/USB and applying via Vibe Mode.
CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_CUSTOM=y
CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_CUSTOM_FILENAME="partitions_int.csv"
CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_FILENAME="partitions_int.csv"
